<https://data.archives.gov.on.ca/KB/Agent/Sons%20of%20Temperance%20of%20North%20America.%20Ameliasburgh%20Division%20No.%2092> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#history> "It was founded in New York City in 1842, and flourished in mid nineteenth century North America. The organisation was divided into subordinate, grand and national divisions." .
